# CITATION.cff — Citation File Format (https://citation-file-format.github.io/)
# Machine-readable citation metadata for the ST-LLM-Plus Thesis Bundle.
# GitHub, Zenodo, and other archives auto-detect this file and surface a
# "Cite this repository" UI on the repo page.

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this bundle, please cite both the source paper and the TimeMMD dataset using the references below."
title: "ST-LLM-Plus Thesis Bundle: Bilingual Technical Report + MVGT-Net Implementation + TimeMMD Dataset"
abstract: >
  A complete, audited thesis bundle for ST-LLM+ (Graph Enhanced Spatio-Temporal
  Large Language Models for Traffic Prediction, IEEE TKDE 2025). Contains
  bilingual (Persian + English) thesis reports, a complete PyTorch implementation
  of the proposed MVGT-Net extension, the REAL TimeMMD dataset (9 domains,
  17,504 records, 322 MB), a GPU recommendation for RTX 3080 Ti, and a
  single-command end-to-end execution pipeline.
